Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 13:30:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/45] decide: schema compilation, validation, catalogue
 rendering, hash

Adds tools/decide/decide-schema.{h,cpp}: JSON request compilation into a compiled_schema (choice/score/bool fields), full 400-level validation, the exact system-prompt catalogue renderer, stem/branch text helpers, and FNV-1a hashing. Covered by tests/test-decide-schema.cpp.
